BribeIntegrationConcreteTest
├── When caller is not owner
│   └── It should revert with {OwnableUnauthorizedAccount}
└── When caller is owner
    ├── When the locker is not locked
    │   └── It should revert with {NotLocked}
    └── When the locker is locked
        ├── When there is no gauge for the pool
        │   └── It should revert with {NoGauge}
        └── When there is a gauge for the pool
            ├── When the percentage is greater than bribeable share
            │   └── It should revert with {InvalidPercentage}
            └── When the percentage is smaller or equal to bribeable share
                ├── When the locker is staked
                │   ├── When the beneficiary is address zero
                │   │   ├── When the bribe amount is zero
                │   │   │   ├── It should claim the rewards
                │   │   │   └── It should send the rewards to the owner
                │   │   └── When the bribe amount is not zero
                │   │       ├── It should claim the rewards
                │   │       ├── It should bribe the bribe amount
                │   │       ├── It should emit a {Bribed} event
                │   │       └── It should send the remaning rewards to the owner
